        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-319 (ensure controlled execution — BCP Planning &amp; Testing (PA-26.1).) | - operational: DC Operations Manager review and approval gate
Owner: DC Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
