    <bpmn:process id="W_W1393" name="W1393. Store-Level IT Disaster Recovery, POS System Failover &amp; Manual Operations Procedure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store POS system failure — complete outage (all terminals down), network connectivity loss to HQ/data center, or regional internet outage affecting multiple stores
Frequency: ~100–200 complete POS system outages/year across 200 stores (individual store, per W580); ~1–2 regional outages affecting 10–30 stores simultaneously
Volume: ~10–15 events/year; average outage duration 2–8 hours
Owner: Store Manager (store-level response); IT Operations (system recovery)
Participants: Store Manager, Cashier, IT Help Desk, IT Infrastructure, Regional Manager
Source: workflow W1393 — Store-Level IT Disaster Recovery, POS System Failover &amp; Manual Operations Procedure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1393_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1393_Lane1" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1393_Lane2" name="IT Help Desk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1393_Lane3" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1393_Lane4" name="IT Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1393_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1393_Start6" name="Store POS system failure — complete outage (all terminals down), network connectivity…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task7" name="Outage detection and reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Outage detection and reporting: (a) Cashier or Store Manager notices POS system unresponsive on all terminals; (b) Store Manager checks: is it a single terminal (W206) or all terminals? is internet connectivity light on router green or red? is the issue local (store only) or regional (nearby stores also affected — check WhatsApp group)? (c) Store Manager calls IT Help Desk and reports complete POS outage; IT creates incident ticket with priority &quot;P1 — Store POS Complete Outage&quot;
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task8" name="IT diagnosis and ETA">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT diagnosis and ETA (within 10 minutes): IT Help Desk checks: (a) is the store&#x27;s internet connection up? (ping test); (b) is the ERP/data center accessible from other stores? (c) is there a known regional ISP outage? (d) provides Store Manager with estimated recovery time: (i) &lt; 30 min (ISP blip, auto-reconnect expected), (ii) 30 min–2 hours (requires IT intervention), (iii) &gt; 2 hours (major outage — activate manual operations)
Responsible (R): IT Help Desk
Accountable (A): IT Ops Manager
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task9" name="Decision to activate manual operations">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Decision to activate manual operations: if IT confirms recovery &gt; 2 hours OR unable to provide ETA: Store Manager activates manual operations procedure
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task10" name="Manual operations activation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Manual operations activation (within 15 minutes of decision): Store Manager retrieves manual operations kit from backroom: (a) pre-printed price lists — updated weekly by system with current SRP for top 5,000 selling SKUs; (b) manual sales slips (triplicate carbonless forms) with fields for item description, quantity, unit price, total; (c) standalone calculator; (d) cash float from safe (PHP 5,000/terminal); (e) credit card imprint machine (manual knuckle-buster) as backup for card payments; (f) Store Manager briefs all Cashiers on manual procedure: use price list for pricing, fill manual sales slip, accept cash (give change from float), accept card (manual imprint)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task11" name="Manual transaction processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Manual transaction processing: Cashier processes each transaction: (a) customer selects items; (b) Cashier looks up each item price from pre-printed price list (sorted by department and SKU); (c) fills manual sales slip with item descriptions, quantities, and prices; calculates subtotal, VAT (12%), and total; (d) collects payment: cash (change from float) or card (manual imprint); (e) customer receives copy of manual sales slip as receipt; (f) Cashier retains store copy and audit copy
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: ~5–8 min/transaction (vs. ~3 min with POS)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task12" name="IT recovery">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: IT recovery: IT Operations resolves the underlying issue: (a) internet connectivity restoration (coordinate with ISP), (b) VPN/router reboot, (c) POS application restart, (d) data center failover (if central system issue); IT Help Desk calls Store Manager to confirm system restored; Store Manager verifies: terminal log-in successful, price sync current, inventory sync status green
Responsible (R): IT Ops / Store Manager
Accountable (A): IT Ops Manager
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task13" name="Manual transaction back-entry">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Manual transaction back-entry: after POS system restored, Cashiers enter manual transactions into POS as &quot;Back-Entry&quot; transactions: (a) each manual sales slip entered as a POS transaction with timestamp adjusted to approximate original transaction time; (b) system updates inventory and GL; (c) cash and card payment reconciled against manual sales slips; (d) Store Manager verifies all manual slips are accounted for (no missing or duplicate entries)
Responsible (R): Cashier / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 1–2 hours (post-recovery)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1393_Task14" name="Post-incident report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Post-incident report: Store Manager submits incident report to IT and Regional Manager: (a) outage start/end time, (b) number of manual transactions processed, (c) estimated lost sales (customers who left without purchasing during outage), (d) manual transaction reconciliation status (all slips entered, any discrepancies), (e) manual operations kit adequacy (price list accuracy, sufficient cash float, supplies)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1393_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1393_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1393_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1393_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-319 (ensure controlled execution — BCP Planning &amp; Testing (PA-26.1).) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Store Manager (store-level response); IT Operations (system recovery)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1393_Assoc17" sourceRef="W1393_Annotation16" targetRef="W1393_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow18" sourceRef="W1393_Start6" targetRef="W1393_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow19" sourceRef="W1393_Task7" targetRef="W1393_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow20" sourceRef="W1393_Task8" targetRef="W1393_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow21" sourceRef="W1393_Task9" targetRef="W1393_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow22" sourceRef="W1393_Task10" targetRef="W1393_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow23" sourceRef="W1393_Task11" targetRef="W1393_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow24" sourceRef="W1393_Task12" targetRef="W1393_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow25" sourceRef="W1393_Task13" targetRef="W1393_Task14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1393_Flow26" sourceRef="W1393_Task14" targetRef="W1393_End15" />
    </bpmn:process>
